据易林蛊之归妹云：“下泉苞稂，十年无王。苟伯遇时，忧念周京。”认为“此诗当为曹人美晋苟跞纳敬王于成周而作”。","fullText":"这是曹人赞美晋国苟跞纳周敬王于成周的诗。何楷《诗经世本古义》根据易林蛊之归妹云：“下泉苞稂，十年无王。苟伯遇时，忧念周京。”认为“此诗当为曹人美晋苟跞纳敬王于成周而作”。","notes":"节录题解开头关于写作背景的说明。","partOrder":2,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/153-xia-quan/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"洌彼下泉，浸彼苞稂。愾我寤歎，念彼周京。","sourceLabel":"第 338 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注释","excerpt":"洌，寒冷。按洌应作冽。","fullText":"洌，寒冷。按洌应作冽。下泉，由地下的泉水，亦名狄泉。苞，丛生。稂，生而不结实的果，莠一类的草。愾，愤诗作慨，叹息貌。寤，醒，醒着。周京，周天子的都城。","notes":"节录首章对应词语注释。","partOrder":1,"anchorIds":["seg-001:1-1:洌"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-1-1"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004"]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0002-1:part-2","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/153-xia-quan/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"洌彼下泉，浸彼苞稂。愾我寤歎，念彼周京。","sourceLabel":"第 338 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注释","excerpt":"下泉，由地下的泉水，亦名狄泉。","fullText":"洌，寒冷。按洌应作冽。下泉，由地下的泉水，亦名狄泉。苞，丛生。稂，生而不结实的果，莠一类的草。愾，愤诗作慨，叹息貌。寤，醒，醒着。周京，周天子的都城。","notes":"节录首章对应词语注释。","partOrder":2,"anchorIds":["seg-001:3-4:下泉"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-2-1"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004"]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0002-1:part-3","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/153-xia-quan/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"s